  3474.0 ? dial=c1  "[errata, p.11:] Set the 'elevator' at the first floor by pushing pushbutton 5. / [p.10:] The rotary switch dial at 1 indicates that the elevator is at the first floor; the dial at 7 indicates that the elevator is at the second floor. Similarly, binary output light 5 on indicates that the elevator is at the first floor; binary output light 6 on indicates that the elevator is at the second floor."
  8474.0 ? dial=c1 outLamp5=on  "[errata, p.11:] Set the 'elevator' at the first floor by pushing pushbutton 5. / [p.10:] The rotary switch dial at 1 indicates that the elevator is at the first floor; the dial at 7 indicates that the elevator is at the second floor. Similarly, binary output light 5 on indicates that the elevator is at the first floor; binary output light 6 on indicates that the elevator is at the second floor."
