  8958.7 ? dial=c7  "[p.11:] To call the \"elevator\" to the second floor, push pushbutton 6. The \"elevator\" will immediately move to the second floor (the pointer knob will point to 7). / [p.10:] The rotary switch dial at 1 indicates that the elevator is at the first floor; the dial at 7 indicates that the elevator is at the second floor. Similarly, binary output light 5 on indicates that the elevator is at the first floor; binary output light 6 on indicates that the elevator is at the second floor."
 13958.7 ? dial=c7 outLamp6=on  "[p.11:] To call the \"elevator\" to the second floor, push pushbutton 6. The \"elevator\" will immediately move to the second floor (the pointer knob will point to 7). / [p.10:] The rotary switch dial at 1 indicates that the elevator is at the first floor; the dial at 7 indicates that the elevator is at the second floor. Similarly, binary output light 5 on indicates that the elevator is at the first floor; binary output light 6 on indicates that the elevator is at the second floor."
